{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">RANDOM function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310444","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/RANDOM-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/RANDOM-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"RANDOM-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">RANDOM function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns a random INTEGER value between two\nintegers (inclusive). </p>\n      <div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> This function returns\na number from a <strong class=\"ph b\">pseudorandom</strong> sequence of numbers rather than\na truly random sequence.</div>\n      <p class=\"p\">The Alternate Random Number Generator\n(-rand) parameter determines whether the same sequence of random\nnumbers is generated for each session. For information on this parameter,\nsee <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge Deployment: Startup Command and Parameter Reference</cite>.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RANDOM-function__syntax_GC1A13L2701744\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d105773e108\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"RANDOM-function__idGDO2TP2675342\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>RANDOM ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">low</var> , <var class=\"keyword varname\">high</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">low</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An integer expression that is the lower of the two expressions you are\n            supplying to the RANDOM function. This can be an INT64 value.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">high</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An integer expression that is the higher of the two expressions you\n            are supplying to the RANDOM function. This can be an INT64 value.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"RANDOM-function__example_GC1A13M2701751\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d105773e167\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">Often\nwhen you set up a database for testing purposes, you want to generate many\nrecords without actually keying in data for each record. The <span class=\"ph filepath\">r-random.p</span> procedure\ngenerates 10 Order records and a random number of OrderLines for\neach Order record.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-random.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"RANDOM-function__idGDO2TQ2675349\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE onum  AS INTEGER NO-UNDO.\nDEFINE VARIABLE olnum AS INTEGER NO-UNDO.\n\nDO onum = 1 TO 10 TRANSACTION:\n  CREATE Order.\n  ASSIGN\n    Order.OrderNum  = onum\n    Order.OrderDate = TODAY.\n\n  DO olnum = 1 TO <strong class=\"ph b\">RANDOM(1,9):</strong>\n    CREATE OrderLine.\n    ASSIGN\n      OrderLine.LineNum = olnum\n      OrderLine.ItemNum = olnum.\n  END.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RADIO-SET-phrase.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RADIO-SET-phrase.html\">RADIO-SET phrase</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"RAW-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RAW-function.html\">RAW function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310444","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"RANDOM function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/RANDOM-function.html","type":"Manual"}